{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445440/extras/b24617db3e9ab7bc2144b73d4669c39f.avif?t=1771421866\" width=920 height=180 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fablery is a tactical game blending chess and card-based strategy.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of Heroes inspired by myths and legends from around the world as they clash on a board.<br>Master the abilities of iconic figures like Hades, Alice, Cleopatra, and many more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445440/extras/2c26b34f8a848bbdd40521db439eaac4.avif?t=1771421866\" width=1170 height=410 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445440/extras/791351b33999bc2a777fb324dad6314b.avif?t=1771421866\" width=920 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445440/extras/6cffc924ac7e4f4a23397515fc993733.poster.avif?t=1771421866\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445440/extras/6cffc924ac7e4f4a23397515fc993733.webm?t=1771421866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445440/extras/6cffc924ac7e4f4a23397515fc993733.mp4?t=1771421866\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Every Hero has a unique deck that reflects their personality, universe, and powers.<br>Turn the tide of battle through your tactical decisions.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Fablery, build your strategy using your cards. Deploy powerful units, cast spells, and create countless strategic combinations. Protect your Hero at all costs, set traps, or go all in, choose how you approach each battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445440/extras/9d69e3ac5544d83ec8f396d34f3eacde.avif?t=1771421866\" width=920 height=150 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face opponents in <strong>intense 1v1 battles</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete <strong>solo thematic missions</strong> built around your favorite heroes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with a friend and fight another duo in <strong>2v2 mode</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve <strong>progressively more challenging puzzles</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you love card games, tactical combat, or timeless myths, Fablery offers a unique, accessible experience filled with unforgettable duels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445440/extras/a8f09440b17eb875d153a645818b8ea4.avif?t=1771421866\" width=920 height=180 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3445440?t=1771421866","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3445440?t=1771421866","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445440/593a261c4a9333bbf823d056489d2736d97d43c9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771421866","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445440/593a261c4a9